---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT t.a FROM t JOIN (SELECT count(*) AS n FROM u) g ON t.c = g.n WHERE t.b = 'x'"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, (c#2 == n#5)
   :- Project [a#0, c#2]
   :  +- Filter (b#1 == 'x')
   :     +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1, c#2]
   +- Aggregate [], [count(1) AS n#5]
      +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
